OL,3,GNEWSAReports of man approaching
OL,4,Achildren in villages
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in a transit van has been
OL,7,Fapproaching children in some
OL,8,FLincolnshire villages, according to
OL,9,Freports.
OL,11,FHykeham and Bracebridge Heath Police
OL,12,Fsaid it had received reports of a man
OL,13,Fin a dark-coloured transit van
OL,14,Fapproaching children in the
OL,15,FMetheringham, Scopwick and Kirkby Green
OL,16,Fareas.
OL,18,FAn investigation has been launched and
OL,19,Fthe force said residents may see a
OL,20,F"heightened police presence in the
OL,21,Farea".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
