OL,3,GNEWSAReports of man approaching
OL,4,Achildren in villages
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity beat sergeant for North
OL,7,FKesteven, Alex Taylor said: "We ask
OL,8,Fthat residents remain on alert, look
OL,9,Fout for one another and allow the
OL,10,Finvestigation to progress."
